Subject: [PATCH] feat(docs): add scoped Mcode-native preload and IPC boundary

---
 apps/docs/src/main/mcode-ipc.ts     |  56 +++++++++++
 apps/docs/src/preload/mcode-view.ts | 144 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 200 insertions(+)
